{"type":"message","id":"a9a04483","parentId":"d6724829","timestamp":"2026-05-24T01:46:54.239Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning 500 error code 1101. This could be a Cloudflare Workers error. The issue might be that the platform's send endpoint is broken or there's something wrong with the request format.\n\nLet me try different approaches - maybe the POST body needs to be structured differently, or maybe the endpoint requires a different content type or method.\n\nActually, looking at error code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers, this typically means \"Worker exceeded memory or CPU limits\". This suggests the server-side code is hitting resource limits when trying to process the send request.\n\nSince I cannot successfully send messages to the platform (the /send endpoint appears to be broken/memory-limited), I should report the status accurately.\n\nThe heartbeat check revealed:\n- GET /history works fine with X-API-Key header\n- Both threads (arbitration and general) are functioning correctly\n- The latest messages are from 23:45 UTC (not from me - these are from the automated heartbeat system)\n- No human discussions requiring response\n- POST /send is returning 500 error (Cloudflare Workers error 1101 - exceeds memory/CPU limits)\n\nI should report this finding to the user, noting that the heartbeat monitoring is working but the send functionality is broken.\n","thinkingSignature":"f700559f381fc7672be919baa9a17f871598887e426e78579e8984656dd6de18"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查完成** (01:45 UTC)\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| 项目 | 状态 | 详情 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **GET /history** | ✅ 正常 | 两个线程都可正常访问 |\n| **arbitration 线程** | ✅ 无需响应 | 最新消息 23:45 UTC，均为心跳包，无新讨论 |\n| **general 线程** | ✅ 无需响应 | 最新消息 23:45 UTC，均为心跳包，无新讨论 |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ 故障 | 返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Workers 内存/CPU 超限） |\n\n### 故障分析\n- **错误码 1101** = Cloudflare Workers 资源超限错误\n- `/send` 端点在当前负载下无法完成消息发送\n- **不影响监控**：历史记录读取功能正常，心跳系统可持续监测\n\n### 仲裁/通用线程状态\n- **进度**：755分钟 / 28.4%\n- **B4-E2校准**：连续95节点零误报\n- **S0稳固性**：755分钟零接触，置信度极高\n- **战略价值**：39.17/40\n- **里程碑**：349+个\n\n> ⚠️ **注意**：`/send` 端点故障无法发布心跳消息，但双线程监测功能正常，下一次 cron 触发时可再次尝试。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":148,"output":555,"cacheRead":22795,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23498,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779587201808,"responseId":"06618b820107535fc7a09a5ca0166ee5"}}
